msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"I saw some scary-looking guys putting an injured old man into a car on "
"Ryukyu Boulevard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "What!? Where did they go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Toward the bullring. They must be major bullfighting fans to go in a big "
"group like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Maybe the old timer was dying, and his last wish was to see the fights "
"again. That'd be nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"You a fan yourself? Easiest way to get there is to take a taxi from Ryukyu "
"Boulevard."
msgstr ""

